# This is a Windows-only project and everything in it is checked out with CRLF.
#
# build.bat especially: cmd cannot find a label in a batch file with Unix line
# endings, so `goto :fail` falls off the end of the script and the window closes
# instantly with nothing printed. That is not a hypothetical - it happened, and
# it took a version to work out.
* text=auto eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.dll binary
*.ico binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary
